Licences of the code built into Lumen
=====================================

Lumen is (C) Andrew Youll, 2026. It is built with these, whose licences
are in this directory:

  SQLite 3.49.2          the library's catalogue    public domain
  libjpeg-turbo 3.0.4    JPEG files                 IJG, BSD (3-clause) and zlib licences
  libpng 1.6.44          PNG files                  PNG Reference Library License v2
  zlib 1.3.1             PNG compression            zlib licence
  UnixLib 5.0            C library (GCCSDK)         revised BSD, with parts under the LGPL
  GCC 10.2 runtime       libgcc                     GPL 3 with the Runtime Library Exception

Not built in, but needed (from PackMan): SharedUnixLibrary and
ARMEABISupport, each with its own licence.

The LibRaw plug-in (LumenRaw, a separate package) has its own Licence
file in !Lumen.Plugins.LibRaw: LibRaw is under the LGPL 2.1 (or CDDL).
